msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/real-accessability/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: real-accessability.php
msgid ""
"An accessibility menu for your website - ready-made profiles, contrast "
"modes, text size and spacing, readable font, reading guide and more, styled "
"in your brand color."
msgstr ""
"Ein Menü für Barrierefreiheit auf deiner Website - vordefinierte Profile, "
"Kontrastmodi, Textgröße und Abstände, gut lesbare Schrift, Leselineal und "
"mehr, gestaltet in deiner Markenfarbe."

#. Author of the plugin
#: real-accessability.php
msgid "REALMEDIA"
msgstr "REALMEDIA"

